#
# Printed paths and the two the runbook names. /original is a store-wide Shopify redirect today
# (WEB-MIGRATION-RUNBOOK, "the trap") — sending it to the shop keeps the guidebook's URL alive.
/original            https://shop.ouisi.co/original                                   301
/blog                https://shop.ouisi.co/blogs/how-we-see-a-blog-on-connection      301
/app                 /apps/                                                           301
# The app policies moved to one pattern the day after launch (Paul, 11-02: "Why would these be different formats?").
/apps/privacy        /apps/photologue/privacy/                                        301
/apps/terms          /apps/photologue/terms/                                          301
/apps/daily-privacy  /apps/daily/privacy/                                             301
/apps/daily-terms    /apps/daily/terms/                                               301
# Each app's own address lands on its section of /apps until there are app pages of their own.
/apps/daily          /apps/#daily                                                     302
/apps/photologue     /apps/#photologue                                                302
#
# The portal stays on go.ouisi.co until launch 2 — temporary redirects on purpose.
